{"id": 7186, "result": [{"value": {"choices": []}, "id": "rzGeJLJj_0", "from_name": "flags", "to_name": "image", "type": "choices", "origin": "prediction"}, {"value": {"choices": ["No Error"]}, "id": "NdLV0kbA50", "from_name": "severity", "to_name": "gpt-output", "type": "choices", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 18.9, "y": 17.7, "width": 62.3, "height": 57.5, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_1", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 18.9, "y": 17.7, "width": 62.3, "height": 57.5, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_1", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 18.9, "y": 17.7, "width": 62.3, "height": 57.5, "rotation": 0, "text": ["For instance, many micro studies in development, starting with Townsend's seminal investigation of risk sharing within an Indian village (Townsend, 1994), are based on data collected at the local level; it is not uncommon to observe endowments (say, individual crops) and prices within the village, a context to which our framework directly applies. Even in large economies, our result may still apply directly when individuals belong to a finite (and \"small\") number of homogeneous \"classes\". Finally, an interesting question is how our results can be extended to production economies. The idea is that, in a production context, changes in factor endowments will have an observable impact on factor prices, and that the corresponding equilibrium manifold can in principle be studied in a similar way. All this shall be the subject of further research."]}, "id": "BB_1", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}], "created_username": "10. NAIST nlp_annot_10@naist.ac.jp, 16", "created_ago": "0\u00a0minutes", "completed_by": {"id": 16, "first_name": "10. NAIST", "last_name": "", "email": "nlp_annot_10@naist.ac.jp"}, "task": {"id": 138088, "data": {"ocr": "/lectrans/data/local-files/?d=/large/datas/frederikus-h/lectrans-testset/25.10.annot_tools/label-studio/ocr_check_storage_source/lec_slides/intmd_microeconomics/Dqko567cE9I/24.Dqko567cE9I-Scene-212-01.jpg", "text": "/lectrans/data/local-files/?d=/large/datas/frederikus-h/lectrans-testset/25.10.annot_tools/label-studio/ocr_check_storage_source/gpt_41mini_outs/intmd_microeconomics/Dqko567cE9I/24.Dqko567cE9I-Scene-212-01.txt"}, "meta": {}, "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:32:23.606030Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-01T12:32:23.615329Z", "is_labeled": true, "overlap": 1, "inner_id": 201, "total_annotations": 1, "cancelled_annotations": 0, "total_predictions": 1, "comment_count": 0, "unresolved_comment_count": 0, "last_comment_updated_at": null, "project": 29, "updated_by": 1, "file_upload": null, "comment_authors": []}, "was_cancelled": false, "ground_truth": false, "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:22:55.868098Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-20T07:22:55.868124Z", "draft_created_at": null, "lead_time": 15.971, "import_id": null, "last_action": null, "bulk_created": false, "project": 29, "updated_by": 16, "parent_prediction": 138214, "parent_annotation": null, "last_created_by": null}